/*
 * One keyboard focus ring for the whole app, Compound's: 2px in the focus color (the accent, white in your own bubbles),
 * 1px outside the element and following its corners. It replaces the browser's own ring, so that buttons, links, tabs
 * and avatars that draw no ring of their own get the one Compound's fields, switches and menus draw.
 *
 * _index.pcss imports this file into the lowest cascade layer, under Compound's, the shared components' and the app's
 * stylesheets, so that any of them that draws a ring of its own, an inset one or none at all keeps it. The name has no
 * leading underscore, which keeps rethemendex.sh from also listing the file in _components.pcss, in the app's layer.
 */
:focus-visible {
    outline: var(--cpd-border-width-2) solid var(--cpd-color-border-focused);
    outline-offset: var(--cpd-border-width-1);
}
